* ADG5248F 8:1 analog multiplexer, channel S1 selected
.lib ADG.lib

VDD  VDD  0  15
VSS  VSS  0 -15

VA0  A0   0  0
VA1  A1   0  0
VA2  A2   0  0
VEN  EN   0  5

VIN  IN   0  SINE(0 0.5 1k)

* Pin order: A0 EN VSS S1 S2 S3 S4 D S8 S7 S6 S5 VDD GND A2 A1
XU1 A0 EN VSS IN 0 0 0 OUT 0 0 0 0 VDD 0 A2 A1 ADG5248F

RLOAD OUT 0 100k
CLOAD OUT 0 10p

.tran 0 6m 2m 2u
.meas tran VIN_PP  PP V(IN)  FROM 2m TO 6m
.meas tran VOUT_PP PP V(OUT) FROM 2m TO 6m
.meas tran gain_db PARAM 20*log(VOUT_PP/VIN_PP)

.end
